TO: Director General, ZNBC
CC: Ministry of Information and Media

RE: Request for Media Partnership – National Language Awareness Week (NLAW) | 10–17 June 2025

Dear Sir/Madam,

I am pleased to inform you of the official launch of the National Language Awareness Week (NLAW), running from 10th to 17th June 2025, in support of the proposed National Languages (Official Status) Bill, 2025.

We hereby request ZNBC's partnership in hosting daily segments, talk shows, and awareness features promoting the role of Bemba and Lozi in Zambia’s constitutional development.

Warm regards,

Major Dr. Kabanga Allan
